    <string name="ui_apextuner_creates_a_local_android_vpn_only_for_apps_you" formatted="false">ApexTuner creates a local Android VPN only for apps you select. Their packets are discarded on-device to block network access; ApexTuner does not inspect, store, forward, monetize, or share payloads or browsing content. Unselected apps bypass this tunnel. While blocking is active, selected apps will not have network access.</string>
